e grin burial  family in order to hide yuno from the  dark triad so that they couldn't kill  him  in order to eliminate the last grin  burial claimant  to the throne yuno was left at an  orphanage in hage village  which is located within the remote  forsaken realm  of the clover kingdom an orphanage in  the forsaken realm was the last place  that someone would think to look for a  prince of the spade kingdom  so yuno was successfully protected from  the dark triad  at least until the dark triad invaded  the diamond kingdom  and began expanding into the clover and  heart kingdoms  using the power of their devils or  demons the dark triad is exploiting the  citizens of the spade kingdom  in order to further their expansionist  goals  in fact the dark triad is known for  using citizens of the spade kingdom who  have low mana  as cheap sources of magic for powering  their mobile fortresses  the members of the dark triad also use  citizens of the spade kingdom who do  have a lot of mana  as dark disciples these are powerful  mages who serve directly  under the dark triad and who have the  ability to access a portion of a demon's  power  although they can't access nearly as  much power as members of the dark triad  themselves  finally although at first it might seem  like the dark triad is primarily  interested  in expanding the spade kingdom in  reality they have an even grander  and more devious goal their objective  is to open the tree of cliffhoth a  magical channel that would connect  this world and the demon world if the  tree of cliffhoth is opened  it will allow more demons to pour into  this world from their world  and this would also allow each member of  the dark triad to use  100 of their demons power until the  magical channel between the two worlds  is created  the dark triad members have to satisfy  themselves with using only 70 or 80  percent  of their demon's magic in order to open  the tree of cliffhoth the dark triad  needs to get their hands on two specific  magic attributes dark magic and  world tree magic the only known users of  these magic types in the world of black  clover are of course  yami sukahiro and william vongens  if the dark triad succeeds in opening  the tree of cliffhoth  the world as we know it would cease to  exist demons would destroy the world and  up to 90  of the world's population would be  exterminated and only the very strongest  would be able to survive  and now that we know the basics about  the dark triad  their backstory and their objectives  let's talk about the individual members  and their unique magic attributes the  first member of the dark triad that we  meet  is xenon and he makes quite the  impression  when we first see him he is able to  defeat an entire diamond kingdom  army on his own and he does it  seemingly without breaking a sweat xenon  is so impressive that even the absolute  mad lad luck voltea is intimidated by  him  which is a first in many ways xenon's  imposing introduction in chapter 227 of  the manga  and episode 129 of the anime sets the  stage for the entire spade kingdom war  arc  and it definitely gives us a good idea  about what to expect from the dark triad  in terms of power and combat ability as  a person  xenon seems to be serious ruthless and  all business unlike his siblings he  isn't interested in idol chit-chat or  having a good time  xenon wants to get the job done as  quickly and efficiently as possible  and he doesn't let anyone or anything  stand  in his way as you might expect from a  member of the dark triad  xenon can be extremely bloodthirsty when  the situation calls for it his original  magic attribute  the one that he was born with is bone  magic  xenon has the ability to create and  control sharp and deadly  bones and this includes the ability to  control many bones  at the same time as a result xenon is  able to use his bones to launch  vicious attacks at his opponents attacks  which include  multiple large and sharp bones flying at  the opponent  at the same time he can turn his bones  into weapons such as a spear or a sword  he can use the bones as a defensive  shield and he can also incapacitate his  opponents by  impaling them on his bones this allows  him to capture his opponents alive  if he so desires it is worth noting that  xenon's bone magic  is much stronger now than it was  originally because the power of his  demon  increases the power of his original  magic and this is the case with all  three members  of the dark triad xenon's second magic  attribute  the one that he gained from his demon is  a very interesting form of spatial magic  as the name suggests spatial magic can  be used to  alter the space around you and we have  seen xenon using spatial magic to create  portals which allow him to appear at a  place of his choosing  seemingly out of nowhere this enables  xenon to sneak up on his opponents  before they even realize that he is  there  and we have already seen xenon using  this ability with great effectiveness  in chapter 260 of the manga xenon also  appears to be able to create some sort  of protective cube  around his body xenon spatial magic is  the last out of the six  dark triad magic attributes to be  revealed  so our overall understanding of this  magic  attribute is still pretty limited as of  the making of this video  without the tree of cliffhoth xenon is  able to access  up to 80 percent of his demon's power  next up we have vanica the only female  member of the dark triad  vernica is somewhat of a psychotic  dominatrix  and her dark disciples in particular  appear to be massive  simps they love and worship vanica as  the greatest creature to ever live  but vanica considers the dark disciples  to be completely expendable  something that she demonstrates in  chapter 255  of the manga in terms of personality  vanica  is driven by the love of a good fight  and the desire to have fun  by taking on the strongest possible  opponents  her love of a good fight and her search  for stronger opponents  kind of reminds me of goku from dragon  ball and just like with goku  this love of a good challenge can  sometimes get in the way  of vanica's greater goals for example  even though vernica's initial mission  was to kill loro pachika the queen of  the heart kingdom  she decided to keep loro pechika alive  in order to motivate noel to become  stronger  so that noel can give manika a fun fight  sometime in the future  this is the type of thing that xenon  would never do at least that's what it  seems like to me  so in this sense xenon and vanica appear  to be very different  with that said vanica is also committed  to the tree of clifforth plan  vanika especially likes this plan  because it is likely to lead to the  destruction of 90  of the world's population and so when  everything is said and done  only the strongest mages will survive  this demon apocalypse  vanika likes this idea because she  despises weaklings  and she wants to live in a world where  only the strongest can survive  vanica's original magic attribute is  blood magic  which allows her to create and control  blood  she is able to make giant monsters made  of blood that look like something right  out of stranger things  and she can then use these monsters  against her opponents  in battle vanika's second magic  attribute  the one that she gained from her demon  megicula is  curse magic vanica is able to create  devastatingly strong and resilient  curses  and one of her curses is said to have  killed noel's mother  aussie a silva vanica and megicula were  also able to curse loro pechika  and unless this curse is removed loro  pechika will die  within a few months time vanika is also  able to place curses on her  own dark disciples including a curse  that allows them to come back to life  no matter how many times they are killed  which is absolutely broken  and incredibly overpowered and a curse  that makes these same dark disciples  literally explode if vanica decides that  they are no longer useful to her  vanica is able to access up to 70  percent  of her demon's power and according to  laura pacheca  vaneka's demon megicula is stronger than  the word magic demon  zagred the final member of the dark  triad  and their apparent leader is dante  when we first meet him dante seems like  a pretty relaxed  and light-hearted guy he jokes around he  smiles frequently  and even asks attractive women with  powerful magic like vanessa and gray to  become  his women in that sense dante's outward  persona  couldn't be more different than xenons i  really can't picture xenon trying to  pick up girls  during one of his missions however once  dante is introduced  it doesn't take long for his truly  psychotic side to come out  as a young man dante was bored with life  and he didn't know what to do with  himself  nothing made him feel alive and in order  to deal with this  existential malaise he tried everything  from sleeping with women to killing  animals to killing people  to burning cities but nothing seemed to  work  it was only after he embraced his insane  ideology about humanity  that he became the fun-loving psycho  that he is today  dante is convinced that human nature is  inherently  evil but human beings are always  fighting against that natural instinct  which makes the world boring dante  believes that being evil  is a good thing that being evil means  being true to your nature  and for him the best thing a human being  can do  is embrace their inner evil and embrace  their malice  as their truest and most honest emotion  as such dante likes to provoke his  opponents  into embracing their darkest emotions  and he thinks that being called evil  is actually a compliment dante's  original magic  is body magic or flesh magic this magic  attribute allows him to manipulate the  flesh of his body to a massive extent  and dante's appearance becomes so  grotesque when he uses this magic  that he prefers not using it at all and  so he only uses it when he feels like he  has no  other choice body magic enables dante to  regenerate  almost instantly which means that he can  heal himself from virtually any injury  this includes extremely severe injuries  like being decapitated or losing his  entire torso  clearly this is an incredibly  overpowered ability and it is immensely  useful in battle  as we saw during dante's fight against  tiami and asta  and if this super regeneration wasn't op  enough  dante's body magic also apparently  allows him to stop the aging process  completely which means that dante can  theoretically live forever we can assume  that his original body magic wasn't  this overpowered but after being  enhanced by the demon lucifer  it has become easily one of the most  broken magic attributes  in black clover the only real weakness  of body magic appears to be asta's  anti-magic  only a direct hit with an anti-magic  attack can bring dante down and stop him  from regenerating  dante's second magic attribute the one  that he got from lucifer  is gravity magic gravity magic allows  dante to control  gravity and he can do everything from  making himself fly  by weakening the gravity around him to  making objects and people heavier  forcing them to fall to the ground or  forcing them to move from one spot to  another he can also use gravity magic to  create  powerful weapons and projectiles  including swords  finally dante can make himself faster  and stronger by manipulating the gravity  around him  so for example his own punches can  become heavier  and faster because they are being  enhanced by the gravity around them  like xenon dante can access up to 80  percent  of his demon's power the dark triad are  by far the strongest villains that we  have seen  in black clover so far their access to  demon magic  and their ability to use two separate  magic attributes  make them the most hopey villains in the  series up to this point  if i were to make an educated guess i  would guess that vanica 